  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The equivalent resistance between <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>and</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>B</mi></math> is _______.</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0123_51d2b16f5150.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 204px;\" />.</p>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>&#937;</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>&#937;</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>&#937;</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>&#937;</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0123_415e0bf0c8cf.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 204px;\" /></p><p>Point D and G are at same potential. Same is the case with point E and F.</p><p>Now, resistance between DC and GC are in parallel combination. Similarly, resistance between CE and CF are in parallel combination. The modified circuit will be as shown below considering&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></math>&nbsp;for parallel combination.</p><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0123_73a5c683cd3f.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 190px;\" /></p><p>Therefore, we can write</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>6</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mn>12</mn></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>q</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>&#937;</mi></math></p>"
  }
}